  "instantiate": {
    "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
    "title": "InstantiateMsg",
    "description": "Contract admin configures trusted OIDC/JWT issuers and circuit binding.",
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "issuers",
      "require_registered_claim"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "admin": {
        "type": [
          "string",
          "null"
        ]
      },
      "issuers": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/IssuerConfig"
        }
      },
      "require_registered_claim": {
        "description": "When true, claim_commitment must be registered to `req.account`.",
        "type": "boolean"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "definitions": {
      "Binary": {
        "description": "Binary is a wrapper around Vec<u8> to add base64 de/serialization with serde. It also adds some helper methods to help encode inline.\n\nThis is only needed as serde-json-{core,wasm} has a horrible encoding for Vec<u8>. See also <https://github.com/CosmWasm/cosmwasm/blob/main/docs/MESSAGE_TYPES.md>.",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "IssuerConfig": {
        "description": "Trusted issuer + circuit binding + **inclusion set root**.\n\n## Inclusion set (Headscale / OIDC membership)\n\nThe issuer (or mesh operator) periodically publishes a merkle root over the set of allowed identities (e.g. OIDC `sub` values admitted to a Headscale tailnet, or a JWKS epoch). That root is stored here as `inclusion_set_root`.\n\nThe ZK circuit proves the JWT's subject is a leaf under that root; the root itself is a **public instance** so the contract can check:\n\n```text public_inputs[64..96) == IssuerConfig.inclusion_set_root ```\n\nRotating the root (new epoch of mesh members) is `RotateInclusionRoot`.\n\n## VM verification\n\nWhen `zkid` is set (feature `zk-host`): ```ignore deps.api.proof_instance_verify(zkid, proof, public_inputs)? ```",
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "issuer",
          "verifying_key"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "audience": {
            "description": "Optional audience (`aud`) restriction.",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "inclusion_set_root": {
            "description": "Merkle / membership root of the inclusion set (32 bytes). When `Some`, Authenticate requires matching root in public instances.",
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Binary"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "issuer": {
            "description": "OIDC issuer URL or stable id (e.g. Headscale IdP issuer).",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "verifying_key": {
            "description": "Optional client JWKS thumbprint / hint (not used for host PLONK verify).",
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Binary"
              }
            ]
          },
          "zkid": {
            "description": "CosmWasm circuit id (required for zk-host path).",
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uint64",
            "minimum": 0.0
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  },
